    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822030,
    "RowId": 42800,
    "Text": "Your precious Light shall feed my vengeance..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822090,
    "RowId": 42801,
    "Text": "Purgatory to cleanse your sin."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822134,
    "RowId": 42802,
    "Text": "Shackles of flame, bind my foe!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822178,
    "RowId": 42803,
    "Text": "Light rend you asunder!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822214,
    "RowId": 42804,
    "Text": "Rise from the abyss, O mighty flame."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822262,
    "RowId": 42805,
    "Text": "Pale aberration...prove your worth."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822310,
    "RowId": 42806,
    "Text": "I shall bathe in your blood."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822350,
    "RowId": 42807,
    "Text": "Offer your soul, your suffering..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822398,
    "RowId": 42808,
    "Text": "Burn upon my wrath."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822430,
    "RowId": 42809,
    "Text": "Know your punishment!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822462,
    "RowId": 42810,
    "Text": "Ruination to mortal flesh!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822502,
    "RowId": 42811,
    "Text": "Wither and die..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822530,
    "RowId": 42812,
    "Text": "A curse of Light consume you."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822570,
    "RowId": 42813,
    "Text": "Fire from within, come forth!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822610,
    "RowId": 42814,
    "Text": "You are finished... The abyss take you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822662,
    "RowId": 42815,
    "Text": "Thank you for agreeing to help decorate the cakes, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822730,
    "RowId": 42816,
    "Text": "'Tis a simple matter of carrying the ingredients from the shelves around the room to the central cake stands."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822850,
    "RowId": 42817,
    "Text": "There is, of course, the matter of the mammet pâtissiers. Should they spot you, use the whistle to temporarily disable them!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 822986,
    "RowId": 42818,
    "Text": "First up: one <sheet(ValentionSweetsRecipe,IntegerParameter(1),0)>, if you please!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 823058,
    "RowId": 42819,
    "Text": "Ready, steady...decorate!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 823094,
    "RowId": 42820,
    "Text": "Once you have an ingredient in hand, bring it to the cake stand in the center, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 823190,
    "RowId": 42821,
    "Text": "Take care to avoid the mammet pâtissiers!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 823246,
    "RowId": 42822,
    "Text": "All that remains is to decorate the cake!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 823298,
    "RowId": 42823,
    "Text": "The <sheet(ValentionSweetsRecipe,IntegerParameter(1),0)> is halfway to completion!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 823370,
    "RowId": 42824,
    "Text": "The <sheet(ValentionSweetsRecipe,IntegerParameter(1),0)> is almost complete!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 823438,
    "RowId": 42825,
    "Text": "The ingredients are on shelves around the room! Fetch the ingredients in the recipe, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 823542,
    "RowId": 42826,
    "Text": "Collect the required ingredients and decorations to add the finishing touches to as many cakes as you can."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 823662,
    "RowId": 42827,
    "Text": "The mammets are moving more quickly. Take care, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 823726,
    "RowId": 42828,
    "Text": "Kupopo! Watch out─the mammets seem even madder than before!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 823798,
    "RowId": 42829,
    "Text": "The <sheet(ValentionSweetsRecipe,IntegerParameter(1),0)> is complete! And what a fine cake it looks!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 823890,
    "RowId": 42830,
    "Text": "Next, let us see if we can create a <sheet(ValentionSweetsRecipe,IntegerParameter(1),0)>! "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 823970,
    "RowId": 42831,
    "Text": "It's the final cake! Let your inspiration guide you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824034,
    "RowId": 42832,
    "Text": "Choose the frosting, decorations, and cake toppers that make your heart sing!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824122,
    "RowId": 42833,
    "Text": "I believe we're out of time, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824170,
    "RowId": 42834,
    "Text": "But we haven't much time, kupo... Make haste!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824226,
    "RowId": 42835,
    "Text": "I believe we're out of time, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824274,
    "RowId": 42836,
    "Text": "The final cake is decorated splendidly, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824330,
    "RowId": 42837,
    "Text": "<HeadAll><String>StringParameter(1)</String></HeadAll> Recipe"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824362,
    "RowId": 42838,
    "Text": "Add <String>StringParameter(1)</String>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824386,
    "RowId": 42839,
    "Text": "Add <String>StringParameter(1)</String>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824410,
    "RowId": 42840,
    "Text": "Add <String>StringParameter(1)</String>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824434,
    "RowId": 42841,
    "Text": "Add <String>StringParameter(1)</String>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824458,
    "RowId": 42842,
    "Text": "Thank you for your wonderful help, kupo! I can hardly wait to complete our delivery..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824558,
    "RowId": 42843,
    "Text": "Everyone has their off days─do not take it to heart!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824626,
    "RowId": 42844,
    "Text": "To think you'd decorate five whole cakes... You have proven yourself the master of confection and affection alike, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824758,
    "RowId": 42845,
    "Text": "Four cakes is quite something. You have a knack for cake decorating, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824846,
    "RowId": 42846,
    "Text": "Three cakes, kupo! This should be a feast!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824902,
    "RowId": 42847,
    "Text": "Two cakes─this makes you a fully fledged pâtissier, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 824974,
    "RowId": 42848,
    "Text": "This cake shall more than suffice. As long as you put your heart into it, you've captured the spirit of Valentione's Day, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825114,
    "RowId": 42849,
    "Text": "Our guests will be most delighted. Let us return to the festivities posthaste!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825206,
    "RowId": 42850,
    "Text": "The ingredients you need are no doubt twinkling with anticipation, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825290,
    "RowId": 42851,
    "Text": "Clear the path of threats"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825326,
    "RowId": 42852,
    "Text": "Rescue the citizens"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825358,
    "RowId": 42853,
    "Text": "Find the source of the screams"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825402,
    "RowId": 42854,
    "Text": "Defeat the greater behemoth"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825442,
    "RowId": 42855,
    "Text": "Best make sure the evacuation route is clear first..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825506,
    "RowId": 42856,
    "Text": "Done! Now to aid those people by the canal..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825562,
    "RowId": 42857,
    "Text": "Help is on the way!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825594,
    "RowId": 42858,
    "Text": "There may be other stragglers..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825638,
    "RowId": 42859,
    "Text": "That breeze is awfully warm... Oh no!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825686,
    "RowId": 42860,
    "Text": "First things first─the fire!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825730,
    "RowId": 42861,
    "Text": "Not a moment too soon... I hope that was the worst of it."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825798,
    "RowId": 42862,
    "Text": "A voice...further out!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825834,
    "RowId": 42863,
    "Text": "Somebody, help!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825862,
    "RowId": 42864,
    "Text": "I'll take care of this─make for shelter!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825918,
    "RowId": 42865,
    "Text": "How many are there...?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825954,
    "RowId": 42866,
    "Text": "Thunderheads..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 825982,
    "RowId": 42867,
    "Text": "Keep away from the clouds!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826022,
    "RowId": 42868,
    "Text": "If I never see another storm... "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826066,
    "RowId": 42869,
    "Text": "Nowhere is safe with so many of them..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826118,
    "RowId": 42870,
    "Text": "Some friendly winds, if you please!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826166,
    "RowId": 42871,
    "Text": "It worked!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826190,
    "RowId": 42872,
    "Text": "Grrroooaaar!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826214,
    "RowId": 42873,
    "Text": "The levin grows more volatile... Something is coming."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826278,
    "RowId": 42874,
    "Text": "Ball lightning!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826306,
    "RowId": 42875,
    "Text": "Y'shtola, Sphene─lend me your strength!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826358,
    "RowId": 42876,
    "Text": "The two of us will disperse these balls of lightning!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826422,
    "RowId": 42877,
    "Text": "Take cover behind the spriggan!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826466,
    "RowId": 42878,
    "Text": "The tide is turning. Press the attack!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826518,
    "RowId": 42879,
    "Text": "H-Heeelp!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826538,
    "RowId": 42880,
    "Text": "Our home..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826562,
    "RowId": 42881,
    "Text": "I can still fight! I can!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826598,
    "RowId": 42882,
    "Text": "I have no doubt!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826626,
    "RowId": 42883,
    "Text": "How fortunate that bird made such an impression."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826686,
    "RowId": 42884,
    "Text": "Just keep the lightning at bay a little longer!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826746,
    "RowId": 42885,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826758,
    "RowId": 42886,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826770,
    "RowId": 42887,
