    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826854,
    "RowId": 42894,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826866,
    "RowId": 42895,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826878,
    "RowId": 42896,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826890,
    "RowId": 42897,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826902,
    "RowId": 42898,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826914,
    "RowId": 42899,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826926,
    "RowId": 42900,
    "Text": "You are bound by the limits of flesh. It will betray you."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 826994,
    "RowId": 42901,
    "Text": "Fear compounds fear, eroding your strength."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827050,
    "RowId": 42902,
    "Text": "Do you not see? Death is upon you..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827098,
    "RowId": 42903,
    "Text": "Drag them to their graves."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827138,
    "RowId": 42904,
    "Text": "You will die for me now."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827174,
    "RowId": 42905,
    "Text": "Accepting death is the greatest sin a life can commit."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827242,
    "RowId": 42906,
    "Text": "Those who do not resist death deserve it."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827294,
    "RowId": 42907,
    "Text": "Still alive. But there are ways to change that."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827354,
    "RowId": 42908,
    "Text": "You struggle in vain."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827386,
    "RowId": 42909,
    "Text": "Fight if you must."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827418,
    "RowId": 42910,
    "Text": "I will reduce you to aether."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827458,
    "RowId": 42911,
    "Text": "I am prepared for you."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827494,
    "RowId": 42912,
    "Text": "Fall to ruin."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827518,
    "RowId": 42913,
    "Text": "Once the terror takes root, it will only continue to grow."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827590,
    "RowId": 42914,
    "Text": "The endless darkness engulfs you..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827638,
    "RowId": 42915,
    "Text": "...Why do you persist?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827674,
    "RowId": 42916,
    "Text": "And here it ends for you."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827710,
    "RowId": 42917,
    "Text": "Mankind must evolve."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827742,
    "RowId": 42918,
    "Text": "Kill them."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827766,
    "RowId": 42919,
    "Text": "Perhaps this."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827790,
    "RowId": 42920,
    "Text": "Bothersome."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 827814,
    "RowId": 42921,
    "Text": "There."
  },
  {
